{"id":"n40022-3-7","stage":0,"title":"기름 · 润滑油","scene":"设备与维修","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40022-3-7-1","ko":"기계가 잘 안 돌아가요.","zh":"机器运转得不太好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기계가","meaning":"机械，机器","explanation":"기계：机械，机器；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기계","audio":"/audio/5eb260fa2e31046f6526.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62451","senseId":"1","lemma":"기계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기계가","audio":"/audio/9640ba96b1a91594b6fa.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가요.","meaning":"运转，运行","explanation":"돌아가다：运转，运行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"4","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가요","audio":"/audio/7df8e3c19cafef70fd78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5eb260fa2e31046f","term":"기계","zh":"机械，机器","audio":"/audio/5eb260fa2e31046f6526.mp3","entryId":"62451","definition":"做一定工作的工具或装置。","pronunciation":["기계","기게"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"运转，运行","audio":"/audio/11